  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Smart Grid Technologies Reverse Trade Mission, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) series will bring delegates from Malaysia, the Philippines, and Vietnam to the United States to familiarize them with state-of-the-art U.S. technologies, services, and best practices to improve the safety, efficiency, and reliability of smart grid infrastructure. The Malaysia and Philippines RTMs will primarily focus on advanced grid solutions and energy integration, while the Vietnam RTM will primarily focus on grid cybersecurity solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
